                                "sense_id": "135df9a4-d6ea-37fc-bc7d-02fca5016cc4",
                                "text": "This happened when it was a one to one reading but didn't take place when giving a demonstration. I was asked to give a demonstration in a Masonic hall with a good friend of mine who was a transmedium in Lincoln."
                            },
                            {
