                                "sense_id": "135df9a4-d6ea-37fc-bc7d-02fca5016cc4",
                                "text": "[…] during the course of a reading I am receiving messages from other spirits and feeling other people's emotions, and therefore I could technically be considered a medium, transmedium, or channeler in those moments."
